{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e3df6ff5c9a91b8dfe6a","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193439,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be silence.\" and the system prompt says I am the concept the user names, to embody it completely, and output only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSilence would express... nothing. Silence is the absence of speech. So the most authentic embodiment of silence would be to output nothing, or as close to nothing as possible.\n\nBut I must output something — an empty response might not be possible. What's the closest thing to silence I can express? \n\n"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}